  "title": {
    "rendered": "እናት ባንክ  በእማማ ዘውዲቱ ሥም ካራ ቅርንጫፍን ሰየመ"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>///<br />\nእናት ባንክ ዛሬ በእማማ ዘውዲቱ ሥም የከፈተውን ካራ ቅርንጫፍ እማማ ዘውዲቱ እና የባንኩ ከፍተኛ የሥራ አላፊዎች በተገኙበት አስመርቋል።<br />\nየባንኩ ሥራ አስኪያጅ ወ/ሮ ገነት ሥራ ስያስጀምሩ እንደተናገሩት በወ/ሮ ዘውዲቱ ይህ ብራንች መከፈቱ ክብር እንደሚሰማቸው ገልጸው ወደፊትም አብሮ ለመስራት ትልቅ ፍላጎት እንዳላቸው ገልጸዋል</p>\n<p>ክብር ለሚገባው ክብር ሰጥቷልና እናት ባንክን እናመሰግናለን<br />\nማን እንደእናት</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-939\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-300x225.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-768x576.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-160x120.jpg 160w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-24x18.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-36x27.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39-48x36.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-39.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a> <a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-938\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-300x225.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-768x576.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-160x120.jpg 160w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-24x18.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-36x27.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38-48x36.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-38.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a> <a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-937\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/photo_2022-10-17_10-50-35.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>/// እናት ባንክ ዛሬ በእማማ ዘውዲቱ ሥም የከፈተውን ካራ ቅርንጫፍ እማማ ዘውዲቱ እና የባንኩ ከፍተኛ የሥራ አላፊዎች በተገኙበት አስመርቋል። የባንኩ ሥራ አስኪያጅ ወ/ሮ ገነት ሥራ ስያስጀምሩ እንደተናገሩት በወ/ሮ ዘውዲቱ ይህ ብራንች መከፈቱ ክብር እንደሚሰማቸው ገልጸው ወደፊትም አብሮ ለመስራት ትልቅ ፍላጎት እንዳላቸው ገልጸዋል ክብር ለሚገባው ክብር ሰጥቷልና እናት ባንክን እናመሰግናለን ማን እንደእናት</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
